msgid ""
"Most of the time, there are ways to achieve the same blocking operations in "
"an asynchronous/reactive\n"
"way, using https://smallrye.io/smallrye-mutiny/[Mutiny], https://hibernate."
"org/reactive/[Hibernate Reactive]\n"
