msgid "Negotiation"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"One of the main ideas of REST (https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7231#section-3."
"4[and HTTP]) is that\n"
"your resource is independent of its representation, and\n"
"that both the client and server are free to represent their resources in as "
"many media types as\n"
"they want. This allows the server to declare support for multiple "
"representations and let the\n"
"client declare which ones it supports and get served something appropriate."
msgstr ""

